/候选素材_官方/区域标注/第二模型/动作动画png/**/*.png

# Local 720p source sequences added for the crystal-dress model. Keep the
# original authoring frames in place; commit only previews, atlases and hashes.
/候选素材_官方/模式二新添加动作/**/*.png

# Local long-idle decoration frame exports. Deterministic cleaned animated
# WebP overlays and hashes are committed by prepare_crystal_interactions.py.
/候选素材_官方/睡觉小装饰/**/*.png

